data: {"id": "2c36f11609284953-final", "run_id": "2c36f11609284953", "seq": 2417, "ts_ms": 1789109342932, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 持续处于 Pending 状态，调度失败 (FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` (Fact: fact-5ece098656c4) | `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.` | 确认调度器判定所有节点资源不足且无法抢占 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | 容器资源限制 (Fact: fact-1d619719e15f) | `1Pi` (1 PiB) | 暴露 Pod 配置的极值内存限制 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | 容器资源请求 (Fact: fact-62a56250fab5) | `1Pi` (1 PiB) | 暴露调度器必须满足的 1 PiB 内存硬请求 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Pod 状态 (Fact: fact-3bc27a916066) | `PodScheduled=False`, `reason=Unschedulable` | 证明 Pod 处于不可调度的终态 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus (Fact: fact-4407cf92f67e) | `1125899906842624` bytes (1 PiB) | 独立数值确认 Pod 内存请求量为 1 PiB |\n\n上述证据表明，Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的 `Pending` 状态是由资源调度失败引起的。调度器返回的 `3 Insufficient memory` 错误，结合 K8s 配置中高达 `1Pi` 的内存 Request/Limit 以及 Prometheus 指标中精确的 `1125899906842624` bytes 数值，构成了闭环证据链。由于配置请求量远超常规集群节点的物理内存上限，导致无任何节点可满足资源约束，且缺乏可被驱逐的预emption 对象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了 1PiB (1,125,899,906,842,624 bytes) 的内存请求/限制 → \n调度器在 0/3 节点上无法找到满足该硬性请求的资源 → \n调度失败 (Insufficient memory) 且无抢占空间 (No preemption victims) → \nPod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 资源请求超出集群节点物理上限**。\n\n事实支持如下：\n1. **配置极值异常**：容器 `app` 的内存请求 (`resource_request.memory`) 和限制 (`resource_limit.memory`) 均被设置为 `1Pi` (Fact: 2, 3)。\n2. **调度失败验证**：Kubernetes Event 明确指出所有 3 个节点均因 `Insufficient memory` 拒绝调度，且不存在可用于抢占 (Preemption) 的 Pod (Fact: 1)。\n3. **数据一致性**：Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_resource_requests` 精确确认了该内存请求量为 `1125899906842624` bytes (Fact: 5)，证实了 `1Pi` 并非幻觉，而是 Pod 的实际配置状态。\n\n鉴于 1 PiB 的请求量远超一般 K8s 集群节点（通常在数十 GiB 级别）的物理极限，这是不可调和的资源约束冲突。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 97.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 97.2s (Evidence 87.1s, RCA 10.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 129.593, "metrics": {"run_id": "2c36f11609284953", "mttr": {"value": "2.2m", "seconds": 129.59969234466553, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 129599.69234466553, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 99110.36038398743, "tool_calls": 30, "executed_tool_calls": 25, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 30, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 62052.25992202759, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 30148.447513580322}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20743.807792663574, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 97250.67496299744, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11583.781242370605, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

